Package: PharmaStatsR
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Methods and Workflows for Pharmaceutical Research
Version: 0.1.63
Authors@R: person(given = "Diogo", family = "Ribeiro",
    email = "dfr@esmad.ipp.pt", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2022-7072",
                 affiliation = "Faculdade de Media Artes e Design, Universidade Técnica do Porto"))
Description: Provides transparent wrappers and reproducible workflows for
    common statistical analyses in pharmaceutical research, including
    hypothesis tests, regression, survival and competing-risk models,
    dose-response methods, adaptive designs, resampling, missing-data
    workflows, covariate preprocessing and screening, pharmacometric
    diagnostics, and meta-analysis. Functions emphasize explicit inputs and
    inspectable outputs, with optional backends for Bayesian, mixed-model,
    reporting, and cross-language workflows. Includes small simulated datasets
    and worked vignettes.
